OL,3,GNEWSA'An absolute one-off' - former BBC
OL,4,Abroadcaster Conor Bradford dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer BBC News NI radio and TV
OL,7,Fbroadcaster Conor Bradford has died.
OL,9,FThe veteran presenter spent four
OL,10,Fdecades on the airwaves before retiring
OL,11,Fin 2022, presenting Inside Ulster, Good
OL,12,FMorning Ulster and Evening Extra.
OL,14,FAdam Smyth, director of BBC Northern
OL,15,FIreland, said Bradford was an "absolute
OL,16,Fone-off".
OL,18,F"His on-air and off-air personas were
OL,19,Fexactly the same; flamboyant, witty,
OL,20,Fwarm and curious - he was a pleasure to
OL,21,Fproduce," he said.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
